# This file specifies snyk vulnerabilities to be ignored.
# If this file contains only comments, then no vulnerabilities are ignored.
# Referenced in the workflow's synk-test.
#
# There is one entry per vulnerability the current scan reports, and no others.
# When a scan stops reporting a vulnerability its entry and its docs/vulns file
# are removed; git holds the earlier assessments. Entries expire after 30 days so
# each assessment is re-reviewed rather than ignored forever.
